<title>FRANCE: EU grants preferential maize imports to Spain.</title>
<headline>EU grants preferential maize imports to Spain.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday granted a maximum tariff reduction of 58.42 Ecus per tonne for the import of 215,797 tonnes of non-EU maize to Spain, grain officials said.</p>
<p>There were no other commercial decisions affecting grain at weekly cereals management committee talks, they said.  </p>
<p>The maize award completes a quota for preferential imports in a tender that was to have run until next week.</p>
</text>
